{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"5f9aa72c25a4331100c1ea1c7df4aea8c7e242b103c21e6b11df61283bbb446d","digest":{"component_or_area":"LLM eval runner configuration","key_entities":["PydanticAIRunner","LLMConfig.repo_path","eval_solver.run_case","runner._effective_config","evals/eval.py::_live_solver","evals/eval_solver.py::run_case","evals/eval_solver.py::_rerooted","tickets_path","src/rebar/llm/evals/eval.py","src/rebar/llm/evals/eval_solver.py","src/rebar/llm/runner.py","completion-verifier.eval.yaml"],"problem_keywords":["standing eval","completion-verifier","repo_path","disposable fixture","wrong checkout","filesystem tools","ticket store"],"propositions":["Standing eval completion-verifier constructs a single PydanticAIRunner before entering per-case disposable repositories, causing its LLMConfig.repo_path to point to the eval checkout.","Filesystem and ticket tools read the checkout instead of each case's fixture repository because runner._effective_config preserves the base repo_path and only substitutes per-request model/limit tuning.","Targeted complete cases fail because agentic tools cannot find fixture files such as src/cli.py or app/profile.py in the disposable repository when the agent reads from the checkout path.","The fix re-roots the injected PydanticAIRunner at each disposable case store via eval_solver._rerooted and clears tickets_path so ticket tools read the fixture's seeded store rather than the checkout."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787609480753257001,"uuid":"af45a602-d746-4d73-82fe-11f29716426c"}